  "marketplace.listing.phoneHint": { id: "Tidak tampil di etalase — hanya dibuka ke pembeli setelah Anda menerima penawarannya.", en: "Not shown in the showcase — only revealed to the buyer after you accept their offer.", ms: "Tidak dipaparkan di etalase — hanya dibuka kepada pembeli selepas anda menerima tawarannya.", th: "ไม่แสดงในหน้าร้าน — เปิดเผยให้ผู้ซื้อหลังคุณตอบรับข้อเสนอเท่านั้น", fil: "Hindi ipinapakita sa showcase — ipapakita lang sa mamimili kapag tinanggap mo ang alok niya.", vi: "Không hiển thị trên gian hàng — chỉ cho người mua thấy sau khi bạn chấp nhận đề nghị." },
