  "marketplace.withdrawForm.otherRequired": { id: "Tuliskan alasannya untuk pilihan \"Lainnya\".", en: "Write the reason for the \"Other\" option.", ms: "Tulis sebabnya untuk pilihan \"Lain-lain\".", th: "ระบุเหตุผลสำหรับตัวเลือก \"อื่นๆ\"", fil: "Isulat ang dahilan para sa \"Iba pa\".", vi: "Hãy ghi lý do cho lựa chọn \"Khác\"." },
  "marketplace.withdrawForm.soldToNexbill": { id: "Laku ke outlet NEXBILL yang melihat barang ini di Etalase? Jangan tarik barangnya — minta outlet itu menekan Ajukan Beli, lalu terima penawarannya. Transaksinya tercatat, pendapatan Anda terbukukan otomatis, dan Anda terlindungi fitur keamanan Marketplace (rekening terkunci, bukti, jalur aduan).", en: "Sold to a NEXBILL outlet that saw this item in the Showcase? Don't withdraw it — ask that outlet to press Request to Buy, then accept their offer. The deal is recorded, your revenue is posted automatically, and you're protected by the Marketplace security features (locked account, proof, report channel).", ms: "Laku kepada outlet NEXBILL yang melihat barang ini di Etalase? Jangan tarik barangnya — minta outlet itu menekan Mohon Beli, kemudian terima tawarannya. Transaksinya direkodkan, hasil anda dibukukan secara automatik, dan anda dilindungi ciri keselamatan Marketplace (akaun dikunci, bukti, saluran aduan).", th: "ขายให้สาขา NEXBILL ที่เห็นสินค้านี้ในหน้าร้านใช่ไหม? อย่าถอนสินค้า — ให้สาขานั้นกด ขอซื้อ แล้วตอบรับข้อเสนอ ธุรกรรมจะถูกบันทึก รายได้ลงบัญชีอัตโนมัติ และคุณได้รับการคุ้มครองจากฟีเจอร์ความปลอดภัยของ Marketplace (บัญชีถูกล็อก หลักฐาน ช่องทางร้องเรียน)", fil: "Naibenta sa NEXBILL outlet na nakakita ng item na ito sa Showcase? Huwag itong bawiin — hilingin sa outlet na pindutin ang Humiling Bumili, saka tanggapin ang alok. Maitatala ang transaksyon, awtomatikong maitatala ang kita mo, at protektado ka ng seguridad ng Marketplace (naka-lock na account, patunay, daan sa reklamo).", vi: "Đã bán cho một cửa hàng NEXBILL thấy món này trên Gian hàng? Đừng gỡ hàng — hãy nhờ cửa hàng đó bấm Yêu cầu mua rồi chấp nhận đề nghị. Giao dịch được ghi nhận, doanh thu tự động vào sổ, và bạn được bảo vệ bởi tính năng an toàn của Marketplace (tài khoản khóa, chứng từ, kênh khiếu nại)." },
  "marketplace.withdrawForm.feeStillApplies": { id: "Ujrah tetap berlaku sesuai ketentuan Marketplace.", en: "Ujrah still applies under the Marketplace terms.", ms: "Ujrah tetap dikenakan mengikut terma Marketplace.", th: "ค่า ujrah ยังมีผลตามเงื่อนไขของ Marketplace", fil: "May ujrah pa rin ayon sa patakaran ng Marketplace.", vi: "Ujrah vẫn áp dụng theo điều khoản Marketplace." },
